# Corpus: two for-loops — `for a in 1 2 $(seq 5 10)` (with a command
# substitution in the word list) and `for ARG` (no `in` list). Two ForClause
# nodes; the command substitution in the first loop's list is present.
<<<cmd
"$TP" run std.shell --input test/suite/shellfamily/inputs/statements__5.sh --dump-tree
<<<assert
exit 0
out-absent ERROR
out-absent MISSING
out-count 2 ForClause [
out-contains CommandSubstitution
